iv style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;음성 중단은 업무 취소와 다르다. 생성 완료는 실제 전달과 다르다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=23;fontColor=#5F6B77;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="839" width="1120" height="29.900000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n48" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;01  입력 보호와 처리 병행&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="364" width="596" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n49" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;긴 해석 중에도 입력과 중단을 받음.&lt;br&gt;비동기는 두 안의 공통 조건이다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="411" width="596" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n50" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;02  정정 전 효과와 전달 제어&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="515" width="596" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n51" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;미전송 효과·오래된 응답을 보류하고,&lt;br&gt;실제로 들은 범위에 맞게 이어간다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="562" width="596" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n52" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;03  분기·대기·합류의 조직&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=28;fontColor=#2858A5;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="666" width="596" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n53" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.4;&quot;&gt;중앙의 명령·반환 관리와&lt;br&gt;소비자 활성화·국소 결합을 비교한다.&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=25;fontColor=#18232E;fontStyle=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1260" y="713" width="596" height="70" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="dp45-background" name="04-45 기억과 Context의 공급 구조"><mxGraphModel dx="1920" dy="1080" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1080" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="n1" parent="1" vertex="1" value="" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;rounded=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1.7;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="0" y="0" width="1920" height="1080" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;VIA SOFTWARE ARCHITECTURE / DP 배경&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=20;fontColor=#087E8B;fontStyle=1;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="64" y="25" width="1250" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.3;&quot;&gt;04-45&lt;/div&gt;" style="fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;f